## Runbook

1. Page the on-call in #payments-oncall.
2. Freeze deploys with `deployctl freeze payments`.
3. Check the **settlement-q** depth.
- [x] Dashboards updated
- [ ] Alarms reviewed

!! Never replay webhooks by hand; use the replay tool.
! Settlement runs at 02:00 UTC.

> Make the common path fast and the rare path safe.
> — Platform principles

table = option,cost,latency,verdict; SQS,low,25 ms,**chosen**; Kafka,high,8 ms,overkill; RabbitMQ,medium,12 ms,ops burden
\table stakes are high this quarter.
